---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /faq/
title: 常見問題｜東津代天府靈帝殿
description: 關於東津代天府靈帝殿的廟史淵源、分靈關係、班頭制度、迎王祭典與參拜服務的常見問題。
firebase: true
extraCss:
  - faq.css
extraJs:
  - faq.js
---

<section class="page-head" data-glyph="問" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">常見問題</div>
    <h2 class="title">常見問題</h2>
    <p class="lede">整理信眾常詢問的問題。廟史、分靈與神尊身世相關的答覆，一律以東港祖廟記載為準。若有其他疑問，歡迎電洽管理委員會 08-8335469（晚間 7 點後）。</p>

    {%- for group in faq.groups %}
    <h3 class="faq-group-title">{{ group.title }}</h3>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {%- for item in group.items %}
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>{{ item.q }}</span><span class="faq-chev" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>{{ item.a }}</p></div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}

    <p class="faq-more">
      更多內容：<a href="/about/">廟史與神尊</a>　·　<a href="/stories/">靈帝殿故事</a>　·　<a href="/events/">祭典行事曆</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{%- set faqFlat = [] %}
{%- for g in faq.groups %}{% for it in g.items %}{% set faqFlat = (faqFlat.push(it), faqFlat) %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for it in faqFlat %}
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ it.q | dump | safe }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ it.a | dump | safe }} } }{{ "," if not loop.last }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
